            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Here is the commit that should fix this: f73ec147427fe998823a5e6b31b16bbfc3bc8ee0\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI adjusted the test to have a bit less comments (they usually show the intent of codeblock/subtest or clarify some *really* non-obvious behavior) and use `child.fn.bufnr(test_path)` to find the target buffer (instead of relying that it is always `vim.api.nvim_list_bufs()[1]`).",
